[[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237763\">1028H10</a></p>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (Right).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (Right).</p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237454\">1008C14</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237654\">1016C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237609\">1084A16</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the connecting rod cap (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the bottom big end bearing shell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014963.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<p>1. Remove the connecting rod with the piston.</p><p>2. Remove the upper connecting rod half-bearing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014964.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the connecting rod - piston assembly and upper bearing shell\n(1a) using a suitable fitting tool (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The connecting rod - piston assembly\nis fitted in the cylinder block so that the number stamped on the\nsmall end is facing the inlet side.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014965.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<p>Fit the connecting rod cap complete with\nhalf-bearing, and tighten the bolts to the specified torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The connecting rod cap is fitted\nso that the number on it is facing the same way as the one stamped\non small end.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>BIG END BEARING CAPS</p></td><td><p>M9</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.4 ÷ 2.6 + 60?</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Use the appropriate tool for angular tightening\nof the connecting rod cap bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237609\">1084A16</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237654\">1016C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237454\">1008C14</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (Right).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (Right).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237763\">1028H10</a>\n                                           bearing in mind to only work\non the cylinder involved.</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237763\">1028H10</a>\n                                           bearing in mind to only work\non the cylinder involved.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237763\">1028H10</a>\n                                           , bearing in mind to only\nwork on the cylinder involved.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237763\">1028H10</a>\n                                           , bearing in mind to only\nwork on the cylinder involved.</p>"]]